{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:checkedHeldRecordLimit:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/grant(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Consent.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L42"},"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","title":"Consent","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Consent","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentStatus","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/NegativeHeldRecordLimit"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Consent"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Consent","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app makes one where it starts, from the decisions it saved, gives it to its tracker, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"updates it as the user decides:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let consent = Consent([.analytics: .granted])","let tracker = Tracker(consent: consent)","\/\/ Later, from the consent prompt:","consent.grant(.advertising)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each event is gated by its type’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event.consentCategory"},{"type":"text","text":", by the decisions made before it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Granted:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" delivered as any event is, written to the tracker’s store first if it has one."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Undecided:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" held in memory, and not written to the store, until the category is decided.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Granting it delivers its held events in the order they were tracked, before any event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracked after the grant; denying it drops them, reported on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","type":"reference"},{"text":". The hold keeps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at most ","type":"text"},{"code":"heldRecordLimit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" events across every category and tracker: when it is full, its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"oldest is dropped to make room, reported as it happens (merged with the overflow reports","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not yet read). Held events are lost if the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends first.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Denied:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" dropped, and not collected at all, so not reported.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Records a store recovered from an earlier run are gated again as the tracker starts, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent may have changed since. One whose category is now denied is dropped, reported and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forgotten by the store. One whose category is undecided is held outside the bound, still kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the store, so a full hold never drops it; if the app ends first, it is gated again on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"next launch. One the store drops for its own byte bound while held is reported by the store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and still delivered if granted in this run, as a record a delivery has already read is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A category not given a status is undecided. Withdrawing consent is a denial: records the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker had already let through when it was granted are still delivered.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Copies share one set of decisions and one hold. A decision returns at once, from any thread:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it records the status, which ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" returns from then on, and queues the decision","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for each tracker given the consent, whose own worker releases or drops what it held. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker reports its own drops.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","text":"ConsentCategory"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers13ConsentStatusO","text":"ConsentStatus"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"heldRecordLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","title":"init(_:heldRecordLimit:)","abstract":[{"text":"A consent with the categories in ","type":"text"},{"code":"statuses","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" decided, and every other undecided.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/init(_:heldrecordlimit:)","type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/defaultHeldRecordLimit":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultHeldRecordLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/defaultheldrecordlimit","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The most records a consent holds unless it is given another bound: 1,000."}],"title":"defaultHeldRecordLimit","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","title":"Trackers","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker app code tracks events with, and what it applies to each event before it is delivered: enrichers, samplers and consent."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/ConsentStatus":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentStatus","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ConsentStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ConsentStatus","abstract":[{"text":"Where the user stands on one consent category.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consentstatus","type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/grant(_:)":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/grant(_:)","title":"grant(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/grant(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Grants "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"categories"},{"type":"text","text":": their held events are delivered, oldest first, and later ones as they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are tracked."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"grant","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","text":"ConsentCategory","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"...)","kind":"text"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/deny(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deny","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentCategory","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"...)","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/deny(_:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Denies "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"categories"},{"type":"text","text":": their held events are dropped, reported on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ones are not collected."}],"title":"deny(_:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/dropReports":{"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports","title":"dropReports","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"